y Relative Strength Index was looking oversold. After breaking 42.30, dollar/rupee potentially targeted 38.28 over the long term, a level unseen since late 1997.   \par \par \uc2 "Any upside (dollar/rupee) corrections are likely to be limited by the 41.53-41.79 area," it said.   \par \par \uc2 INDIA-RUPEE/STANDARD CHARTERED|LANGEN|ABN|M|SNI   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070607e367000qu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
