\par\par \b \uc2 Indian rupee slips, inflation watched   \b0\par\par\uc2 332 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Mai 2007\par 04:54\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Updates to open)   \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, May 18 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee inched away from a recent nine-year high on Friday after the dollar strengthened against some \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and as traders waited for inflation data that could give clues to the rupee's future direction.   \par \par \uc2 At 9:45 a.m (O415 GMT), the partially convertible rupee <INR=IN> was at 40.90/91 per dollar, slightly off Thursday's close of 40.8550/8650. The rupee hit a nine-year peak of 40.53 on May 9.   \par \par \uc2 "If today's inflation number is higher that expected, chances of a rate hike increase, which is good for the rupee; if the number is lower than expected, stock market inflows should increase, which is also good for the rupee," said the chief dealer with a private bank.   \par \par \uc2 "I expect the dollar-rupee to trade in a broad 40.80-41 range on Friday."   \par \par \uc2 Annual inflation is forecast at 5.30 percent for the 12 months to May 5, lower than an annual 5.66 percent a week before, a Reuters poll showed on Thursday. The data is due around noon (0630 GMT).   \par \par \uc2 The rupee came under pressure after most Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell against a broadly stronger dollar, and the market was abuzz with speculation that a few Asian central banks, including South Korea's, had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to maintain exporters' competitiveness.   \par \par \uc2 "If Asian central banks are stepping in to weaken their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , that certainly increases the chances of the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  too," said the chief dealer.   \par \par \uc2 The rupee has gained more than 8 percent against the dollar this year to be Asia's best-performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 Data showed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $2.3 billion in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in March, but analysts believe it has acted less aggressively in April and May.    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  --------------------------------------------------------------\par                    MARKET SNAPSHOT\par  Bombay Sensitive Index          <.BSESN>\par  Indian rupee (/$)               <INR=IN>\par  --------------------------------------------------------------\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-INDIA-RUPEE (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|SNI|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070521e35i0004w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
