\par\par \b \uc2 India rupee in sight of 8-yr high; cbank watched   \b0\par\par\uc2 339 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 April 2007\par 05:12\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Updates to open)   \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, April 9 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee inched towards an eight-year high on Monday as the prospect of capital inflows spurred dealers to buy the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but they remained wary of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 At 9:50 a.m. (0420 GMT), the rupee was at 42.75/76 per dollar, up from Thursday's finish 42.90/92 and closing in on an 8-year high of 42.63, according to Reuters data. The market was closed on Friday for a holiday.   \par \par \uc2 "The market's view is that the rupee is going to strengthen ... and that the RBI will most likely stay away," said the chief dealer with a a private bank.   \par \par \uc2 "I expect the rupee to trade in a 42.65-85 range on today," the dealer added.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is suspected of having sold rupees regularly since November in a bid to rein in the local unit, which has risen about 10 percent since last July, when it hit a 3-year low.   \par \par \uc2 The rupee's gains have been powered by robust capital inflows into Asia's fourth largest economy, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is thought to be uncomfortable with the pace of its appreciation.   \par \par \uc2 According to a JP Morgan index, the rupee is overvalued by 10.6 precent, compared with 7.9 percent a month ago.   \par \par \uc2 The RBI's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has fuelled money supply growth and inflation, both running above its target band. With the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  focused on taming inflation, many dealers believe any further \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be muted in the near term.   \par \par \uc2 The dollar strengthened against some Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  after strong March jobs data on Friday eased concerns about a slowdown in the U.S. economy and dimmed the chances of a rate cut in the near term.    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  --------------------------------------------------------------\par                    MARKET SNAPSHOT\par  Bombay Sensitive Index          <.BSESN>\par  Indian rupee (/$)               <INR=IN>\par  --------------------------------------------------------------\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 INDIA-RUPEE/ (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|Table|ABN|M|RBN|SNI|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070412e3490008h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
