\par\par \b \uc2 Indian rupee gains on weak dlr, mkt wary of cbank  \b0\par\par\uc2 312 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2007\par 04:22\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Updates to open)  \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, March 16 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee strengthened against the dollar on Friday after the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell to a three-month low against the euro, but traders were vigilant for signs of equity-related outflows and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 At 9:30 a.m. (0400 GMT), the partially convertible rupee <INR=IN> was at 44.18/19 per dollar, after opening at its highest level since Feb. 27, up from the Thursday's close of 44.22/23.  \par \par \uc2 "Stocks will be an important trigger today ... and while capital flows are still strong, a lot depends on how the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reacts," said the chief dealer at a private bank, who expects the rupee to trade in a 44.18-30 range on Friday.  \par \par \uc2 Traders suspect the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a bid to stem the strength of the rupee, which has gained about 6.5 percent since hitting a three-year trough last July.  \par \par \uc2 Data on Monday showed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought about $2.8 billion in January, in addition to purchases of about $5 billion in November and December. The market widely believes the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  played an active role in February too, when the rupee was blocked at 16-months highs near 44 per dollar.  \par \par \uc2 The main share index <.BSESN> rose in early trades before turning negative, and dealers expect the rupee to come under pressure if foreign funds pare their positions in local stocks.  \par \par \uc2 Foreign investors have invested a net $1.03 billion in Indian equities in 2007, but are net sellers of about $258 million so far in March, official data showed.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  --------------------------------------------------------------\par                     MARKET SNAPSHOT\par  Bombay Sensitive Index          <.BSESN>\par  Indian rupee (/$)               <INR=IN>\par  ---------------------------------------------------------------\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-INDIA-RUPEE/ (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|Table|ABN|M|RBN|SNI|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070319e33g00051\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
