million. It bought a net $8.14 billion in the financial year to March 2006, down from $20.85 billion in 2004/05.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 INDIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -CBANK/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|SNI|ABX|RNP|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070312e33c0019m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
