\par\par \b \uc2 Indian rupee range-bound as cbank presence looms   \b0\par\par\uc2 336 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Februar 2007\par 04:06\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Updates to close)   \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Feb 21 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee traded in a narrow range on Wednesday with investors wary of provoking the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which was once again seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem the local unit's gains.   \par \par \uc2 The partially convertible rupee <INR=IN> ended at 44.185/195 a dollar, virtually unchanged from Tuesday's close of 44.182/190.   \par \par \uc2 "The market lost interest today," said a dealer at a private bank when asked why the session's trading band was so tight.   \par \par \uc2 "The RBI (Reserve Bank of India) has been buying so much recently (dollars), and at so many different levels, that no one knows when they will come in and move the market -- better to stay on the sidelines," the dealer added.   \par \par \uc2 The market believes the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  consistently in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market since November in a bid to drive down the rupee, which has appreciated by about 6.5 percent since hitting a three-year low of 47.04 last July.   \par \par \uc2 Analysts say the it has been selling rupees through state-run banks to preserve export competitiveness and curb volatility.   \par \par \uc2 India's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves rose by about $5 billion on Feb. 9 from a week earlier, a measure of the amount the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  recently, say analysts.   \par \par \uc2 The rupee showed little movement after the Bank of Japan raised interest rates by 25 basis points, even as the yen inched closer to a record low against the euro.   \par \par \uc2 "The rate hike was a non-event for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, and it didn't have any bearing on trade," said the chief dealer at a foreign bank.    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  ---------------------------------------------------------------\par  -                       MARKET SNAPSHOT\par  Bombay Sensitive Index          <.BSESN>\par  Indian rupee (/$)               <INR=IN>\par  ---------------------------------------------------------------\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 - ((Reporting by C.J. Kurrien, editing by Mark Williams; Reuters Messaging: cj.kurrien.reuters.com@reuters.net, 91-22-6636 9037))   \f28 \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-INDIA-RUPEE (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|Table|SNI|ABN|M|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070224e32l0002i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
