\par\par \b \uc2 India rupee steady, traders suspect cbank's hand  \b0\par\par\uc2 341 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Februar 2007\par 04:16\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Updates to close)  \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Feb 5 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee ended steady on Monday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was suspected of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  through state-run banks to check its strength following its rise to a one-year peak in the previous session, traders said.  \par \par \uc2 The partially convertible rupee <INR=IN> ended at 44.105/115 per dollar, a shade higher than Friday's close of 44.11/12. It had hit a one-year high of 44.05 on Friday, its strongest since Jan. 31, 2006.  \par \par \uc2 "The RBI was passively absorbing rupees at the 44.10 levels, but the broad view is that the rupee will gradually slip to the left (strengthen), despite intermittent \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said the chief dealer with a private bank.  \par \par \uc2 A spokeswoman for the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to comment on whether it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday.  \par \par \uc2 Data showed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought about $5 billion through \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in November and December.  \par \par \uc2 According to a JP Morgan index <JPMREER>, the rupee is overvalued by 9.3 percent. A stronger rupee hurts the competitiveness of Indian exporters.  \par \par \uc2 "Significant \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strength would be uncomfortable for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , because that would mean exporters' competitiveness was deteriorating," said an analyst with a foreign bank.  \par \par \uc2 "From that perspective I don't expect the rupee to appreciate significantly from here," said the source, who expects the rupee to weaken by about 2 percent by the end of the quarter.  \par \par \uc2 Sentiment on the rupee was boosted last week after Standard and Poor's upgraded India's credit rating to investment grade and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  increased interest rates.  \par \par \uc2 On Monday, Finance Minister Palaniappan Chidambaram said the rating upgrade was likely to lead to increased foreign investment.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  ---------------------------------------------------------------\par  -                        MARKET SNAPSHOT\par  Bombay Sensitive Index          <.BSESN>\par  Indian rupee (/$)               <INR=IN>\par  ---------------------------------------------------------------\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 - ((Reporting by C.J. Kurrien, editing by John Mair; Reuters Messaging: cj.kurrien.reuters.com@reuters.net, 91-22-6636 9037))  \f28 \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-INDIA-RUPEE/ (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABN|M|RBN|SNI|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070208e3250007l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
