\par\par \b \uc2 India Bonds Rise On Ctrl Bk's Policy Review; Rupee Up  \b0\par\par\uc2 572 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Februar 2007\par 14:37\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                    As Of 1200 GMT \par                    Latest      Change \par  USD/INR           44.11       -0.03 \par  7.59% 2016 Bond   7.69%       -3bps \par  8.07% 2017 Bond   7.69%       -3bps \par  Call Rate*        7.50%       -30bps \par  \par  Forward Dollar Premium/Discount* \par  January          INR1.31     -0.04 \par  \par  Interest Rate Swaps \par  2-Year Mifor*     7.99%       -12bps \par  5-Year Mifor*     8.04%       -16bps \par  5-Year OIS*       7.61%       -1bps \par  \par    *Forward Dollar Premium/Discount, Call Rate, Mifor and OIS rates are midpoints of bid-offer spreads. \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 MUMBAI (Dow Jones)--India government bond prices rose Friday, buoyed by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's third-quarter monetary policy review, but the market is likely to open weak in the next session after the government announced an INR90 billion bond auction, traders said.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 "The market is likely to start on a bearish note next week because of the auction announcement," said a private bank dealer.  \par \par \uc2 The government announced after market hours Friday that it will sell INR60 billion worth 7.37% 2014 bonds and INR30 billion worth 8.33% 2036 bonds Feb. 9.  \par \par \uc2 However, the dealer said prices are likely to bounce back over the week since most of the traders are currently short on the government paper. "They will come back to the market."  \par \par \uc2 The 8.07% 2017 bond ended at INR102.60 Friday, up from INR102.37 Wednesday. The bond market was shut Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 In its monetary policy review Wednesday, the Reserve Bank of India had kept its short-term borrowing rate unchanged at 6%, while raising the lending rate by 25 basis points to 7.50%. It refrained from a cut in the banks' statutory liquidity ratio, or SLR.  \par \par \uc2 Many market participants had thought the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might cut the SLR level, a move that would result in reduced demand for bonds from banks.  \par \par \uc2 SLR, currently at 25%, is the proportion of deposits a bank must keep in cash, gold or approved securities.  \par \par \uc2 Bond prices fell marginally after the government released its inflation data, but they soon recovered in Friday's session.  \par \par \uc2 "The market is not that worried, which is why the fall was mild," said one dealer. "Since the RBI has kept its inflation target of 5.0%-5.5%, most traders are not expecting inflation to shoot through the roof - 6.30% looks maximum for inflation."  \par \par \uc2 India's wholesale price index-based inflation for the week ended Jan. 20 accelerated to 6.11% on the year, from 5.95% in the previous week, largely due to rising food and manufactured product prices.  \par \par \uc2 In the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the Indian rupee ended marginally higher against the dollar Friday, helped by strong foreign fund flows into the country's stock market.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar ended at INR44.11, slightly down from Thursday's close of INR44.14.  \par \par \uc2 Market participants said non-deliverable forward dollar sales by foreign banks also contributed to the rise of the rupee.  \par \par \uc2 They said the dollar would have fallen further but for the rumored \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 "I expect the dollar-rupee to trade in a range of INR44.00-INR44.35 next week. The RBI is unlikely to allow the pair to breach the INR44.00 level as exporters are already uncomfortable with the rising rupee," said a state-owned bank dealer.  \par \par \uc2 -By Vipin V. Nair; Dow Jones Newswires; 91 22 22884212; djn.in@dowjones.com [ 02-02-07 1337GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 1164 1847 62506  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020070202e322000rp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
