\par\par \b \uc2 Indian rupee steady as traders eye cbank for cues  \b0\par\par\uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Januar 2007\par 04:05\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Updates to open)  \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Jan 19 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee was little changed on Friday, after the yen held near a four-year low against the dollar, and traders were wary of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 At 9:45 a.m. (0415 GMT), the partially convertible rupee <INR=IN> was at 44.33/34 against the dollar, compared with the previous session's close of 44.335/345 when it weakened on suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 The dollar held firm against the yen after the Bank of Japan left interest rates unchanged at the end of a two-day policy meeting on Thursday.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  often \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to protect export competitiveness and curb volatility in the rupee, analysts said. It \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily in November to pull the rupee down from an eight-month high, data released earlier this week showed.  \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  probably \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the last session, so it's not a normal day and the market is very cautious," said the chief dealer with a foreign bank.  \par \par \uc2 "We have to see if this is part of a sustained effort on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's part to weaken the rupee or if they were just looking to mop up excess dollars," he added.  \par \par \uc2 JP Morgan said in a note "pronounced rupee strength of 9 percent against the unofficial \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  real-exchange effe