\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  cbank bought $3.2 bln in  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  in Nov  \b0\par\par\uc2 236 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Januar 2007\par 14:39\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Jan 16 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $3.2 billion in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  during November, when the rupee rose to near-eight-month highs that have since been surpassed, the Reserve Bank of India's monthly bulletin showed on Tuesday.  \par \par \uc2 Large foreign buying of stocks pushed the rupee <INR=IN> to a high of 44.35 against the dollar on November 10 -- its highest since late March according to Reuters data -- before the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell sharply in a move the market attributed to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Capital inflows of about $8 billion in 2006 helped the country's share index rise by nearly 47 percent last year.  \par \par \uc2 Before November, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in May, when it bought $504 million. It bought a net $8.14 billion in the financial year to March 2006, down from $20.85 billion in 2004/05.  \par \par \uc2 After rising about 4 percent against the dollar in the December quarter, the rupee hit an 11-month high of 44.13 per dollar earlier this month.  \par \par \uc2 The rising rupee has hurt exporter earnings, and analysts said that was probably a factor behind the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Infosys Technologies , the country's second-biggest software exporter, said last week the rupee's rise shaved 200 basis points off its operating margins in the quarter.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 INDIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|ABN|M|SNI|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070116e31g002h1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
