\par\par \b \uc2 India Rupee Rises To 9-Month High; Bonds Down  \b0\par\par\uc2 545 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Dezember 2006\par 14:22\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                    As Of 1200 GMT \par                    Latest      Change \par  USD/INR           44.45       -0.11 \par  7.59% 2016 Bond   7.62%       +3 bp \par  Call Rate*        10.75%      +150 bps \par  \par  Forward Dollar Premium/Discount \par  November          INR1.52     +INR0.23 \par  \par  Interest Rate Swaps \par  2-Year Mifor*     7.99%       +10 bps \par  5-Year Mifor*     8.09%       +10 bps \par  5-Year OIS*       7.51%       +6 bps \par  \par    *Forward Dollar Premium/Discount, Call Rate, Mifor and OIS rates are midpoints of bid-offer spreads.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 MUMBAI (Dow Jones)--The Indian rupee rose to its highest closing level against the dollar in over nine months Tuesday, fueled by robust foreign fund flows, but the market is cautious about its further gains, traders said.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 The market will be wary about the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 , or RBI, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the dollar in the coming sessions, they said.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar ended at INR44.45, its lowest finish since March 21, as against INR44.56 on Friday's close.  \par \par \uc2 "I think the RBI is likely to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the dollar-rupee tries to breach INR44.35 tomorrow," said a dealer with a local bank, who expects the dollar to trade in INR44.35-INR44.50 range Wednesday.  \par \par \uc2 "Generally the market seems to be bullish on the rupee because foreign fund flows to the stock market should continue at good levels," the dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 Foreign fund flows into India's stock market have been a major factor that pushed up the rupee in recent times, prompting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to reportedly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market on a number of occasions.  \par \par \uc2 The Bombay Stock Exchange's 30-stock Sensitive Index rose 236.60 points, or 1.8% to 13,708.34 Tuesday.  \par \par \uc2 In the government bond market, prices fell Tuesday amid meager volumes.  \par \par \uc2 The benchmark 7.59% 2016 bond ended at INR99.74 as compared with INR99.95 on Friday's close.  \par \par \uc2 Bond market participants said the market is unlikely to recover during this week as liquidity conditions remain tight with banks' cash reserve ratio, or CRR, going up by 25 basis points to 5.25% from Dec. 23.  \par \par \uc2 The CRR will further rise by another 25 basis points from Jan. 6.  \par \par \uc2 The RBI raised the CRR, which is the proportion of time and demand deposits a bank must hold in cash with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to absorb about INR135 billion from the banking system.  \par \par \uc2 "The bond market doesn't have many cues now. The volumes will stay thin during this week," said a dealer with a local bank.  \par \par \uc2 Some players expect the current liquidity squeeze to ease by mid-January.  \par \par \uc2 According to Anindya Dutta, Treasurer at Calyon Bank, more funds are expected to flow into the banking system over the next couple of weeks through government's interest payments to provident funds and likely \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the RBI in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to support the dollar.  \par \par \uc2 Dutta said he expects the bond market to revive once the liquidity conditions improve.  \par \par \uc2 "I expect the 10-year bond yield to touch 7.45% by mid-January (from the current 7.62%)," he said.  \par \par \uc2 -By Vipin V. Nair, Dow Jones Newswires; 91 22 22884212; djn.in@dowjones.com [ 26-12-06 1322GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 1164 1847 62506  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020061226e2cq000ap\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
