\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  c.bank did not  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  market in Oct  \b0\par\par\uc2 244 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Dezember 2006\par 09:29\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Dec 14 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in October for the fifth month in a row, data released on Thursday showed.  \par \par \uc2 But that could change when the data for November is released after a two-month lag, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is suspected to have bought dollars in November to rein in a rising rupee, they said.  \par \par \uc2 The rupee <INR=IN> was at 44.73/74 a dollar at 1:07 p.m. (0737 GMT), weaker than 44.35 hit on Nov. 10 that was the strongest since late March.  \par \par \uc2 After sliding to a three-year low of 47.04 in mid-July, the rupee has steadily appreciated helped by strong capital flows into a bullish stock market.  \par \par \uc2 India's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves rose to a record $175.489 billion on Dec. 1, up nearly $8.4 billion from late October which dealers said reflected suspected central \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 The data, released in the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's monthly bulletin, showed it last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in May when it bought $504 million, following on from $4.31 billion purchases in April, when it was acting to maintain India's export competitiveness.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought a net $8.14 billion in the fiscal year ended March 2006, lower than $20.85 billion in 2004/05.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INDIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /CBANK|LANGEN|SNI|ABN|M|ABX|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020061214e2ce001mb\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (india near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\cl